message: "If you cite this corpus, please cite it as below."
title: "Corpus Iuris"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A harness-neutral body of rules for directing agentic work — Spec-Driven
  Development provisions, behavioural rules and caselaw, written to be cited
  rather than restated, plus the transforms that carry the base to harnesses
  other than the one it was authored on.
